@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Unduh Format Surat Izin (Siswa)
actor "Siswa" as S
boundary "UI" as UI
control "Controller" as C
entity "File System" as FS

== Akses Halaman Surat Keterangan ==
S -> UI: 1. Akses sidebar "Format Surat"
UI -> C: 2. Request surat keterangan page
C -> FS: 3. Check availability format surat file
FS --> C: 4. Return file status
C --> UI: 5. Load surat keterangan page
UI --> S: 6. Tampilkan halaman surat keterangan dengan tombol unduh

== Unduh Format Surat ==
S -> UI: 7. Klik tombol "Unduh"
UI -> C: 8. Handle download request
C -> FS: 9. Get format surat file
FS --> C: 10. Return file data
C --> UI: 11. Prepare file download
UI --> S: 12. Mulai proses download file
note right
File format surat izin
ketidakhadiran siswa
(format: PDF/DOC)
end note
UI --> S: 13. File berhasil terunduh ke perangkat siswa
@enduml